Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.86,0:00:04.65,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,（感谢字幕：cosjav_subs_sc）
Dialogue: 4,0:00:10.97,0:00:12.22,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,我换好衣服啦 ~
Dialogue: 3,0:00:12.87,0:00:13.97,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哇，好厉害
Dialogue: 4,0:00:16.58,0:00:17.49,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎么样呀
Dialogue: 3,0:00:17.68,0:00:19.52,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哎呀，超适合你的
Dialogue: 3,0:00:28.30,0:00:30.50,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哇，真的好适合你啊
Dialogue: 4,0:00:30.83,0:00:31.73,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,很适合我吗
Dialogue: 3,0:00:31.49,0:00:32.04,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 3,0:00:32.49,0:00:33.61,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,真是太神了
Dialogue: 3,0:00:32.49,0:00:35.98,Default-Box,atg4,0,0,0,,（该流行语出自 Re:Zero，形容某人某事厉害到惊人。后面会多次出现）
Dialogue: 4,0:00:33.91,0:00:35.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，很神奇什么的…
Dialogue: 3,0:00:35.05,0:00:35.98,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,鬼斧神工啊
Dialogue: 4,0:00:35.98,0:00:37.55,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那是人家的台词才对吧
Dialogue: 3,0:00:37.28,0:00:38.24,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，还真是（抱歉抱歉）
Dialogue: 3,0:00:38.69,0:00:41.13,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不是啦，是说你的还原度超高的
Dialogue: 4,0:00:41.81,0:00:42.82,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,很适合我吗
Dialogue: 3,0:00:42.45,0:00:43.19,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 3,0:00:43.68,0:00:45.91,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,简直就像角色本人一样
Dialogue: 4,0:00:47.65,0:00:50.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真的吗？人家超期待今天的
Dialogue: 3,0:00:49.88,0:00:51.06,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,诶诶，真的吗
Dialogue: 4,0:00:51.16,0:00:51.98,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 4,0:00:52.24,0:00:55.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我一直都有在看万太郎先生的 SNS (社交媒体) 呢
Dialogue: 3,0:00:55.44,0:00:56.38,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,诶，真的吗
Dialogue: 4,0:00:56.42,0:00:58.71,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯，真的超期待今天的
Dialogue: 3,0:00:58.59,0:00:59.84,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哪里哪里，彼此彼此啦
Dialogue: 3,0:01:00.91,0:01:03.40,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,那个，我也经常看你的作品
Dialogue: 4,0:01:03.40,0:01:05.23,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯，诶、你真的有在看吗
Dialogue: 3,0:01:04.90,0:01:06.30,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,拍了好多照片对吧
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.30,0:01:06.94,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 3,0:01:06.70,0:01:07.34,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 4,0:01:08.26,0:01:09.87,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人家今天也是干劲满满哦
Dialogue: 3,0:01:09.93,0:01:12.11,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,干劲满满吗，哇、好棒啊
Dialogue: 3,0:01:13.07,0:01:13.92,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,你很喜欢吗
Dialogue: 4,0:01:14.11,0:01:15.59,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯，超喜欢的
Dialogue: 3,0:01:16.69,0:01:19.89,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,那个角色有什么著名的台词吗
Dialogue: 4,0:01:20.29,0:01:21.03,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 4,0:01:21.57,0:01:24.18,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,是那句吗？   “简直是神了”
Dialogue: 3,0:01:24.18,0:01:24.99,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 4,0:01:25.18,0:01:27.13,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是刚才已经被你抢先说掉了啦
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.34,0:01:28.53,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,抱歉已经说掉啦
Dialogue: 3,0:01:28.62,0:01:29.82,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,除了这个，没有别的了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:01:30.88,0:01:31.60,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.07,0:01:36.88,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,“就让我们从这里开始吧，从一开始…   不，是从零开始 ~”
Dialogue: 3,0:01:37.98,0:01:39.15,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哇啊，好棒
Dialogue: 4,0:01:40.17,0:01:40.90,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,喜欢吗
Dialogue: 3,0:01:40.90,0:01:42.14,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,我还以为是本人呢
Dialogue: 3,0:01:42.86,0:01:43.61,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 3,0:01:44.15,0:01:45.14,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,难得有机会…
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.18,0:01:46.98,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,嗯，请多拍一点吧
Dialogue: 3,0:01:46.68,0:01:47.49,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 3,0:01:47.51,0:01:48.94,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,那我们开始吧
Dialogue: 4,0:01:49.00,0:01:50.51,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要把我拍得可爱一点哦
Dialogue: 3,0:01:50.51,0:01:52.48,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哎呀，你本来就已经很可爱了嘛
Dialogue: 3,0:01:52.75,0:01:54.74,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,我只要按下快门就行了
Dialogue: 4,0:01:55.76,0:01:58.18,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那么，今天就请多指教啦
Dialogue: 3,0:01:57.85,0:01:58.79,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,请多指教
Dialogue: 3,0:02:01.07,0:02:01.81,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,要开始咯
Dialogue: 4,0:02:01.87,0:02:03.39,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯，拜托了
Dialogue: 3,0:02:03.13,0:02:04.70,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好，我会拍很多的哦
Dialogue: 4,0:02:04.75,0:02:05.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 3,0:02:07.61,0:02:08.56,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 3,0:02:10.36,0:02:11.36,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊啊，对对
Dialogue: 3,0:02:13.01,0:02:14.82,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哇，很熟练嘛
Dialogue: 3,0:02:15.98,0:02:17.55,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，不错
Dialogue: 3,0:02:17.94,0:02:21.28,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，好好，稍微…   下面过来一点
Dialogue: 3,0:02:21.28,0:02:22.48,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: 3,0:02:24.86,0:02:26.86,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好熟练啊、摆姿势什么的
Dialogue: 4,0:02:27.80,0:02:28.54,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,没有啦
Dialogue: 3,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.07,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，你看你看，很熟练吧
Dialogue: 3,0:02:31.83,0:02:32.67,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 4,0:02:33.07,0:02:35.84,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那个、万太郎先生的照片拍的真厉害呢
Dialogue: 3,0:02:35.65,0:02:36.54,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,诶，真的吗
Dialogue: 4,0:02:36.83,0:02:38.88,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,是啊，根本就不需要修图嘛
Dialogue: 3,0:02:38.88,0:02:40.08,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没有没有没有啦
Dialogue: 4,0:02:40.60,0:02:43.60,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,好厉害！简直是神了呢
Dialogue: 3,0:02:44.58,0:02:46.89,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,这句我收下了
Dialogue: 4,0:02:47.21,0:02:48.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是太神了呢 ~
Dialogue: 3,0:02:49.24,0:02:50.36,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不错哦，这样
Dialogue: 3,0:02:52.88,0:02:54.06,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,那个，也来拍点视频吧
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.62,0:02:55.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好呀，要怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 3,0:02:54.97,0:02:55.97,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,说过的吧
Dialogue: 4,0:02:56.60,0:02:57.84,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 3,0:02:57.21,0:02:58.46,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,呐，也可以拍视频的对吧
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.51,0:02:59.65,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯，请拍吧
Dialogue: 3,0:03:00.02,0:03:01.51,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好，那我就拍了
Dialogue: 3,0:03:05.03,0:03:05.80,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 3,0:03:06.93,0:03:07.68,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哇，好棒
Dialogue: 3,0:03:08.01,0:03:12.00,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,果然还是视频更好呢，更有动态感
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.29,0:03:14.48,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,视频更好吗
Dialogue: 3,0:03:14.15,0:03:14.97,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 4,0:03:15.30,0:03:18.78,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，但是拍视频的话，就不知道该摆什么姿势了
Dialogue: 3,0:03:17.90,0:03:19.82,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，等一下，那就，那个那个
Dialogue: 3,0:03:20.53,0:03:23.96,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,就刚才那个，那个“从零开始”，再来一次
Dialogue: 3,0:03:24.50,0:03:25.50,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,再来一次吧
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.50,0:03:26.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你很喜欢那个啊
Dialogue: 3,0:03:26.35,0:03:27.79,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,喜欢喜欢喜欢，超可爱的
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.61,0:03:28.34,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶 ~
Dialogue: 4,0:03:30.02,0:03:34.79,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“就从这里开始吧，从一开始，不，是从零开始哦 ~”
Dialogue: 3,0:03:36.31,0:03:36.98,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 3,0:03:37.51,0:03:38.71,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,确实很厉害呢
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.24,0:03:42.27,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，你在拍哪里呀
Dialogue: 3,0:03:41.73,0:03:44.83,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没有没有没有，不是什么奇怪的地方啦
Dialogue: 3,0:03:45.94,0:03:46.86,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好厉害呢
Dialogue: 3,0:03:48.63,0:03:49.36,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不错
Dialogue: 3,0:03:53.99,0:03:56.82,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,那个，我可以问你的三围吗
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.58,0:03:59.48,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，你想知道吗
Dialogue: 3,0:04:00.63,0:04:04.72,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,诶，那个嘛，因为听你说自己身材很好嘛
Dialogue: 4,0:04:06.08,0:04:08.01,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我的胸部可是很大的哦
Dialogue: 3,0:04:10.08,0:04:11.46,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,确实，确实
Dialogue: 3,0:04:15.21,0:04:16.58,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，等下、好险
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.11,0:04:17.74,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 3,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.02,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不，就是感觉有点危险呢
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.44,0:04:23.68,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,想看吗
Dialogue: 3,0:04:24.19,0:04:25.62,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哎呀，这个嘛…
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.01,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,骗你的啦
Dialogue: 3,0:04:29.46,0:04:31.09,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，好厉害啊，确实
Dialogue: 3,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.12,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 4,0:04:34.59,0:04:35.37,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可爱吗
Dialogue: 3,0:04:35.08,0:04:35.88,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,可爱
Dialogue: 3,0:04:37.14,0:04:37.98,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.58,0:04:51.88,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你好像一直在拍人家的乳沟呢
Dialogue: 3,0:04:51.07,0:04:53.85,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没有没有，哪有，没有那种事，没有啦
Dialogue: 3,0:04:55.31,0:04:59.01,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,就是有点、有点吸引眼球，虽然是会忍不住看一眼啦
Dialogue: 4,0:04:59.38,0:05:01.31,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是人家今天没有穿内衣哦
Dialogue: 3,0:05:01.17,0:05:01.88,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,诶？！
Dialogue: 3,0:05:02.55,0:05:06.50,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,诶，但是有贴什么的吧，像乳贴之类的东西…
Dialogue: 4,0:05:06.50,0:05:07.53,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,没贴哦
Dialogue: 3,0:05:07.61,0:05:08.79,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,什么什么
Dialogue: 3,0:05:09.86,0:05:12.14,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,为什么，会贴的，会贴的吧
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.56,0:05:14.11,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，人家没有贴哦
Dialogue: 3,0:05:16.38,0:05:17.55,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,这不太妙吧
Dialogue: 3,0:05:18.40,0:05:20.59,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,有点太暴露了吧，有点不妙呢
Dialogue: 4,0:05:21.14,0:05:22.67,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,“有点擦边”是什么意思呀 ~
Dialogue: 3,0:05:22.46,0:05:23.96,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没有没有没有，就是那个…
Dialogue: 4,0:05:23.96,0:05:25.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你想看吗
Dialogue: 3,0:05:26.09,0:05:27.24,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哎呀、想看…
Dialogue: 3,0:05:28.91,0:05:32.49,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,要说、不想看那肯定是骗人的
Dialogue: 3,0:05:34.36,0:05:36.71,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，等下，等一下
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.39,0:05:38.88,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊，呐，变硬了呢
Dialogue: 3,0:05:39.09,0:05:41.89,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没有没有，硬...  应该没有硬起来吧
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.93,0:05:42.66,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 3,0:05:43.11,0:05:44.49,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,诶，等…等一下
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.83,0:05:46.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,真是太神了呢
Dialogue: 3,0:05:47.98,0:05:50.57,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,神了吗…   算很神奇吗
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.62,0:05:53.96,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，为什么硬成这样了呀？
Dialogue: 3,0:05:53.86,0:05:57.98,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没有没有，硬...硬起来了吗，我觉得没有吧
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.50,0:05:58.81,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,已经硬起来了哦
Dialogue: 3,0:05:58.68,0:05:59.69,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没有没有没有
Dialogue: 3,0:06:01.14,0:06:02.16,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不、等一下…
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.59,0:06:08.89,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,硬得好厉害哦
Dialogue: 3,0:06:08.89,0:06:09.58,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没有没有
Dialogue: 4,0:06:09.82,0:06:11.83,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，裤子不觉得紧吗
Dialogue: 3,0:06:11.66,0:06:13.78,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不，嘛，是有点紧啦
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.07,0:06:16.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,变得好鼓了哦
Dialogue: 3,0:06:16.47,0:06:17.66,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,因为你在摸嘛
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.81,0:06:21.12,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你看，裤子是不是很紧啊
Dialogue: 3,0:06:21.26,0:06:23.87,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,呀，是有点紧啦
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.09,0:06:26.01,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，绝对是脱掉会比较好吧
Dialogue: 3,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.46,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不不不，不可以啦
Dialogue: 3,0:06:28.19,0:06:29.19,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不可以的…
Dialogue: 3,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.31,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，等一下
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你平常摄影时都会这么硬吗
Dialogue: 3,0:06:35.56,0:06:39.19,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不不不，才没有那种事
Dialogue: 3,0:06:39.43,0:06:40.52,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,等下，啊，等一下
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.65,0:06:44.23,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,好厉害，好大 ~
Dialogue: 4,0:06:48.49,0:06:50.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,为什么会硬成这样
Dialogue: 3,0:06:50.04,0:06:50.78,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没有啦
Dialogue: 3,0:06:53.82,0:06:57.47,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,因为你，有点太性感了嘛
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.59,0:07:07.94,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,不过，你是不是经常被做这种事啊
Dialogue: 3,0:07:07.96,0:07:09.86,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没、哪有，才没有那种事啦
Dialogue: 4,0:07:12.29,0:07:15.42,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，那你是第一次被这样对待吗
Dialogue: 3,0:07:15.53,0:07:19.83,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不，好像也不是第一次了...  到底是什么来着？
Dialogue: 4,0:07:20.08,0:07:21.83,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊，不是第一次啊
Dialogue: 3,0:07:21.83,0:07:23.40,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不不不，是第一次，是第一次
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.59,0:07:29.89,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,硬得好厉害
Dialogue: 3,0:07:31.97,0:07:33.13,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,肯定会硬的吧
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.12,0:07:48.71,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呐，人家可以舔吗
Dialogue: 3,0:07:48.39,0:07:49.18,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 4,0:07:49.57,0:07:50.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶诶 ~
Dialogue: 3,0:07:50.01,0:07:50.71,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.71,0:07:51.67,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,可以的吧
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.52,0:07:52.66,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不，倒也没问题…
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.94,0:08:13.22,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 3,0:08:13.42,0:08:14.58,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哇，好舒服
Dialogue: 3,0:08:51.38,0:08:52.57,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,有点舒服
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.33,0:08:58.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你的肉棒好硬哦
Dialogue: 3,0:08:58.57,0:08:59.57,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,哎、那是…
Dialogue: 3,0:09:00.99,0:09:02.86,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,因为很舒服嘛
Dialogue: 3,0:09:04.02,0:09:05.20,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,所以就硬起来了
Dialogue: 4,0:09:06.99,0:09:09.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人家对自己的胸部也很有自信哦
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.50,0:09:11.65,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,请你看看吧
Dialogue: 4,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.15,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 4,0:09:18.77,0:09:19.77,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 3,0:09:19.82,0:09:20.67,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.10,0:09:29.91,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,你看，摸一下也可以哦
Dialogue: 3,0:09:30.04,0:09:31.27,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,诶，可以吗
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.65,0:09:34.35,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,摸摸看嘛
Dialogue: 3,0:09:59.81,0:10:01.02,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,软乎乎的
Dialogue: 4,0:10:02.45,0:10:04.08,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,喜欢人家的胸部吗
Dialogue: 3,0:10:05.01,0:10:05.88,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,喜欢
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.27,0:10:09.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人家也最喜欢被揉胸部了
Dialogue: 4,0:10:13.52,0:10:15.64,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊，请再多摸摸吧
Dialogue: 3,0:10:15.37,0:10:16.19,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,再用力点？
Dialogue: 4,0:10:16.21,0:10:16.93,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.77,0:10:23.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊，好舒服
Dialogue: 3,0:10:49.00,0:10:50.93,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,这个好厉害啊
Dialogue: 4,0:11:16.95,0:11:18.48,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,请再多揉捏一下吧
Dialogue: 4,0:11:42.85,0:11:44.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊，好舒服
Dialogue: 3,0:12:03.04,0:12:03.87,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.54,0:12:24.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 3,0:12:28.53,0:12:33.21,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,那个…   也可以帮忙舔一下我的乳头吗？
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.49,0:12:34.96,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯，当然可以
Dialogue: 4,0:12:48.22,0:12:49.62,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,可以开始舔了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:13:51.61,0:13:54.48,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,请不要发出奇怪的声音啦，很好笑哦
Dialogue: 3,0:13:55.15,0:13:59.31,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,（诶诶，那个是…  这样做肯定会叫出来吧）
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.38,0:14:01.01,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，是这样啊
Dialogue: 3,0:14:01.29,0:14:04.16,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,（哇啊，真不错啊，那样应该可以…）
Dialogue: 3,0:14:08.24,0:14:09.56,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,但还是会忍不住叫出来
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.50,0:14:12.68,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯 ~   请不要叫出声来嘛
Dialogue: 3,0:14:12.71,0:14:13.54,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 4,0:14:34.65,0:14:36.47,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊，好厉害，简直神了呢
Dialogue: 3,0:14:37.50,0:14:38.57,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,太神了
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.46,0:15:02.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，要不要用人家的胸部来帮你夹住呀
Dialogue: 3,0:15:03.60,0:15:04.63,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 4,0:15:05.24,0:15:06.98,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那就请你躺下来吧
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.53,0:15:16.22,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,请到这边来
Dialogue: 4,0:15:27.50,0:15:29.93,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,大家都夸我的胸部长得很漂亮呢
Dialogue: 3,0:15:30.22,0:15:34.13,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,真的很漂亮，而且好软啊
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.70,0:15:37.93,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 3,0:15:37.99,0:15:39.34,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊啊，好舒服
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.65,0:15:58.13,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,硬得好厉害呢
Dialogue: 3,0:16:03.02,0:16:04.26,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，那样不行
Dialogue: 4,0:16:10.88,0:16:12.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,再激烈一点的话 ~
Dialogue: 3,0:16:12.98,0:16:15.65,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,再激烈点…   等一下，会受不了
Dialogue: 3,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.51,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，不行
Dialogue: 3,0:16:43.21,0:16:44.33,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,等、等等…
Dialogue: 3,0:16:45.83,0:16:46.88,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 3,0:16:53.32,0:16:54.42,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,太舒服了
Dialogue: 4,0:16:55.23,0:16:57.21,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不要再躲了啦
Dialogue: 3,0:16:56.30,0:16:58.83,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,（不不…  因为太舒服了嘛）
Dialogue: 4,0:17:02.05,0:17:04.36,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊，你的肉棒硬得好厉害哦
Dialogue: 3,0:17:05.29,0:17:06.49,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,因为太舒服了
Dialogue: 3,0:17:13.76,0:17:16.74,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,这样不行、会受不了…   我可以站起来吗？
Dialogue: 4,0:17:21.39,0:17:23.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,那就让人家再舔一次吧
Dialogue: 3,0:18:18.39,0:18:19.95,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊啊，好舒服
Dialogue: 3,0:18:20.40,0:18:24.34,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,不行了，再这样下去，会射出来的
Dialogue: 4,0:18:25.47,0:18:27.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,诶，要射了吗？
Dialogue: 3,0:18:27.41,0:18:28.14,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 4,0:18:29.60,0:18:31.14,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可以尽情地射出来哦
Dialogue: 3,0:18:31.76,0:18:32.74,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 4,0:18:32.90,0:18:33.68,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 4,0:18:35.16,0:18:37.14,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人家想要你射好多好多出来 ~
Dialogue: 3,0:18:52.56,0:18:53.85,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,差不多要射了
Dialogue: 4,0:19:09.33,0:19:10.78,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,射了好多呢
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.41,0:19:20.97,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,多谢款待啦
Dialogue: 4,0:19:26.60,0:19:28.78,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,下次还要再约人家一起拍照哦
Dialogue: 3,0:19:29.32,0:19:31.13,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,嗯，当然
Dialogue: 3,0:19:36.04,0:19:36.90,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 3,0:19:38.75,0:19:40.86,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,超棒的，好好
Dialogue: 3,0:19:44.23,0:19:46.39,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，不错呢，那个姿势，好好好
Dialogue: 4,0:19:45.44,0:19:46.39,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 3,0:19:46.39,0:19:47.33,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,嗯，好可爱
Dialogue: 3,0:19:52.99,0:19:55.59,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，好可爱啊
Dialogue: 4,0:20:00.52,0:20:02.11,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呐，万太郎先生
Dialogue: 3,0:20:02.23,0:20:03.14,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 3,0:20:09.44,0:20:10.74,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,怎么了 怎么了 怎么了
Dialogue: 4,0:20:11.36,0:20:14.06,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,感觉好像只有万太郎先生一个人在舒服呢
Dialogue: 4,0:20:15.97,0:20:18.61,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呐，只有万太郎先生一个人舒服也太狡猾了啦
Dialogue: 3,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.28,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，确实
Dialogue: 4,0:20:20.97,0:20:23.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人家也想变得舒服嘛
Dialogue: 3,0:20:23.62,0:20:25.66,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,诶诶，可以吗
Dialogue: 4,0:20:26.07,0:20:26.85,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 4,0:20:27.61,0:20:30.46,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呐，叫你“主人”可以吗
Dialogue: 3,0:20:31.40,0:20:34.10,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，可以呀、真不错呢
Dialogue: 4,0:20:34.54,0:20:39.45,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呐，主人，人家也想变得舒服嘛 ~
Dialogue: 3,0:20:40.65,0:20:42.32,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊啊，太棒了
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.30,0:20:47.32,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呐，好想让主人把人家弄得舒服一点
Dialogue: 3,0:20:49.24,0:20:50.47,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,（太棒了）
Dialogue: 4,0:20:59.63,0:21:03.44,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好想被主人弄得舒服一点
Dialogue: 4,0:21:06.05,0:21:07.17,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不可以吗
Dialogue: 3,0:21:08.09,0:21:09.09,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 4,0:21:16.46,0:21:19.18,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,主人，想要你来摸摸人家
Dialogue: 4,0:21:48.26,0:21:51.61,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,主人，想要你再多摸摸人家
Dialogue: 4,0:21:58.27,0:21:59.92,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 4,0:22:20.56,0:22:22.18,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,呐，主人…
Dialogue: 4,0:22:24.24,0:22:26.58,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,这边也想让你舔一舔呢
Dialogue: 3,0:22:26.03,0:22:27.04,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,这里吗？
Dialogue: 4,0:22:27.62,0:22:28.80,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不可以吗
Dialogue: 3,0:22:28.80,0:22:29.79,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 4,0:22:36.35,0:22:37.70,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,主人
Dialogue: 4,0:22:38.64,0:22:39.82,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不可以吗
Dialogue: 4,0:22:41.63,0:22:44.34,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,这边也想被你弄得舒服起来嘛
Dialogue: 3,0:22:57.41,0:22:59.01,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 3,0:23:02.12,0:23:03.59,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,（这边真的可以吗）
Dialogue: 4,0:23:03.75,0:23:08.43,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯，想要你直接摸上去
Dialogue: 4,0:23:19.23,0:23:21.62,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不行了，已经忍不住了
Dialogue: 4,0:23:21.98,0:23:24.56,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,主人，好想你来舔舔人家
Dialogue: 3,0:23:32.50,0:23:33.63,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 4,0:23:45.20,0:23:46.07,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,不行… 
Dialogue: 4,0:23:47.31,0:23:48.25,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 4,0:23:49.27,0:23:50.49,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我可以去了吗
Dialogue: 4,0:23:54.62,0:23:55.70,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,不行，要去了
Dialogue: 4,0:24:10.02,0:24:11.57,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊啊、对不起
Dialogue: 4,0:24:12.92,0:24:16.10,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,这么快就去了，对不起
Dialogue: 3,0:24:16.20,0:24:17.63,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,没关系，没关系
Dialogue: 4,0:24:20.05,0:24:24.53,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,但是，还想，还想让你弄得更舒服一点
Dialogue: 3,0:24:29.06,0:24:30.78,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊，已经湿透了啊
Dialogue: 4,0:24:44.30,0:24:46.00,Default,atg2,0,0,0,,啊，进来了
Dialogue: 4,0:24:49.67,0:24:53.03,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,主人，请给我你的肉棒 ~
Dialogue: 3,0:24:53.77,0:24:54.73,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,想要吗
Dialogue: 4,0:24:55.11,0:24:55.99,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,想要
Dialogue: 3,0:24:55.99,0:24:56.94,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,想要啊
Dialogue: 4,0:24:57.21,0:24:57.81,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 3,0:24:58.34,0:24:59.34,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,那就来吧
Dialogue: 4,0:25:00.99,0:25:02.05,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 3,0:25:02.47,0:25:03.25,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 4,0:25:16.24,0:25:17.52,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,啊啊，好厉害
Dialogue: 4,0:25:18.14,0:25:20.18,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,主人的肉棒
Dialogue: 4,0:25:22.44,0:25:24.18,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,可以舔吗
Dialogue: 3,0:25:24.37,0:25:26.81,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,可以哦，好好让我变得舒服吧
Dialogue: 4,0:25:26.94,0:25:27.76,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 4,0:25:28.38,0:25:30.30,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我会好好侍奉您的
Dialogue: 4,0:25:54.18,0:25:56.86,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,人家最喜欢主人的肉棒了
Dialogue: 3,0:25:58.36,0:26:00.80,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,一边看着我的脸、一边舔吧
Dialogue: 3,0:26:08.40,0:26:09.72,Default-L2,atg3,0,0,0,,啊啊，好熟练啊
Dialogue: 4,0:26:15.34,0:26:17.41,Default,atg1,0,0,0,,我会让你舒服个够哦
